5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We should be careful not to create a system that causes friction between neighbors. I'll look into the history of our disputes.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, dear. It's so important to keep the peace. I'm worried about how the bikes are actually handled in the mornings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make sure we aren't ignoring the money side of things! I want to know what the actual costs and market rates are.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I'm concerned about the long-term maintenance of whatever we decide. We need to know the actual workload involved in administration.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I feel like some people have it easier than others! I want to see if the same people always get the best spots.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, that's a fair point. I'll stick to the social atmosphere for now, though.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, your energy is wonderful. It would be good to know if the current layout is fair for everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, you're always so practical. But let's not forget that money makes the world go round, even in a small building.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,I'll be looking into the paperwork. It's better to be realistic about who will actually do the work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm going to check the records! I want to know if the ""lucky"" ones are actually lucky or just staying put.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
